 "comments": [
  {
   "address": 36992,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Disables interrupts and the display, installs the ending IRQ at line $10, sets up six sprites and configures VIC bank $C000 for the bitmap presentation. Copies graphics under the I/O area before restoring $01 to $35."
  },
  {
   "address": 37049,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Opens RAM under I/O. Copies bitmap rows from $D000 and $B800 into $E800\u2013$FEFF, then copies the final 64-byte slice from $BF00 to $FF00. Moves the bank-$C000 workspace, restores I/O, and enters the colour-cell copy."
  },
  {
   "address": 37104,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Copies four overlapping source slices beginning at $B3E8 to the C64 colour-RAM window after restoring access to I/O."
  },
  {
   "address": 37133,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Clears the ending sequence counters and background colours, sets up the text display state and starts the music through $5500 with selector one. Enables interrupts before making the scene visible."
  },
  {
   "address": 37182,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Waits for the IRQ-side code to set $955A before running the fixed delay loops and moving to the next ending phase."
  },
  {
   "address": 37220,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Sets the visible flag at $9163 through the shared following code, then waits for two IRQ acknowledgments through $59."
  },
  {
   "address": 37223,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Clears the visible flag at $9163, then uses the same two acknowledgments."
  },
  {
   "address": 37243,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Copies X complete pages from source high byte A to destination high byte Y. Patches both high-byte operands and increments them after each 256-byte copy."
  },
  {
   "address": 37270,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "First raster handler installed at $908F-$9092."
  },
  {
   "address": 37379,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Clears the display acknowledgment, changes the common sprite colours, and builds four sprite coordinates from a base position at $9161/$9162 before writing their pointers and VIC registers."
  },
  {
   "address": 37844,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Reads the next message item at $9563. Zero sets $9559, $FE toggles an animation bit and continues fetching, space maps to $1C, and $FF maps to $1B. The selected glyph index is masked to six bits."
  },
  {
   "address": 38166,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Iterates through five text areas selected by pointer tables at $95C7 and $95CC and clears 48 bytes at each. Also prepares the VIC colour entries using a self-modified address."
  },
  {
   "address": 38235,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Masks used by $91C8 and $9276 to set an individual sprite's high X bit."
  },
  {
   "address": 38243,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Character and control bytes consumed at $93D6. $FE toggles the animation bit and continues, while zero signals the message end."
  },
  {
   "address": 38353,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Installs the IRQ at $96BB and disables sprites. Clears bitmap RAM backwards beginning at $FF3F before selecting entries from the scene tables."
  },
  {
   "address": 45056,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The first 1000 bytes are the screen colour attributes for the bitmap. $90E9 copies the four pages beginning here to screen RAM at $C000."
  },
  {
   "address": 46056,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Colour RAM source at $90F2. The copy loop writes the four spans beginning at $D800, $D900, $DA00 and $DAE8."
  },
  {
   "address": 47104,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "First 1024 bytes of the bitmap slice copied from $B800 to $F800 by $90CC."
  },
  {
   "address": 48128,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Remainder of the bitmap source slice beginning at $B800. The last 64 bytes starting at $BF00 are copied separately at $90D1."
  },
  {
   "address": 53248,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Bitmap bytes copied to $E800-$EBFF by the page-copy call at $90C3. RAM is visible beneath I/O for this transfer."
  },
  {
   "address": 54272,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Bitmap bytes copied to $EC00-$EFFF by the page-copy call at $90C3."
  },
  {
   "address": 55296,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Bitmap bytes copied to $F000-$F3FF by the page-copy call at $90C3."
  },
  {
   "address": 56320,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Bitmap bytes copied to $F400-$F7FF by the page-copy call at $90C3."
  },
  {
   "address": 57344,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "First 1024 bytes at the VIC bitmap base. The scene uses these directly, before the part copied from $D000 begins at $E800."
  },
  {
